KlN1R8q0G5mTRL5cLl-_UYMOZnL1xz-EXu2WsF-nMwdA&oe=6A9C31C4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=luA9NtXlIkwQ7kNvwGy0Tyj&_nc_oc=AdrVBjiJktAeOR3ZMJsGNKPw3jCPeWHmD7855uCHEUswCaYetU0Vqvokd_hQceTRKGU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIachqY6P48_Wtch4LDAZc6pZL3vVYY62AHu81-GvY2LA&oe=6A9C1662"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vpqxZ-nxRRQQ7kNvwEnoF5E&_nc_oc=AdrsYWLlHzWvwa3iQ2I170pnW5lvRGwZuOrGO6aBWTrOQxTMlr2c22RGyeu6b_ioubQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQICIjDDBH7527Y8zEng-L_uLoHzLZ-EFUF07BM9yoowmQ&oe=6A9C38B3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bm1YPPgiS2oQ7kNvwEkpbYr&_nc_oc=AdpIpjMlvPAsWgCsD7j-8KoFQsE6ZPc3s8Ep2eoRV9QmoBQF5dsfMv9vWlPG8FPSoL4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLb-16a-06F4g73SZeQYcmHR9WprGYqldq7t-VFUEbnOg&oe=6A9C37AF"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h953akQyyo8Q7kNvwGIyXEO&_nc_oc=Adq-v8H5S5EZ487WtmWmVX6NDGdTbyg3UsBd-8Lx16TeqFz6qsAI6I7NheaV4lZV1OQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK13Nzoh9uRrvUlwH_idL-I-FrLgXLP7xBfQsEBNGFJ1Q&oe=6A9C33A5"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m5WbgtuZ9tQQ7kNvwEUws3h&_nc_oc=AdqoAMaVwTvSIH4FftImQpzrEl4aFm2aF9uXjfAnwZ7W4Yu7kbcjF1dYnRQ_yqMVlY0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLk6d_AQqU-WDn4yr4Kgfc2Yno9jAL1tp86oR41U8a9UQ&oe=6A9C328D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hx5dBWluBAkQ7kNvwGcxWiU&_nc_oc=AdoGfuMhEIHGxPUp6w0hwG4kFDuX4ZwEu_rRIXKUcJOqPgcgdNZ5nzRnNjn1XWA5aF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=